# Layout Specifications

## Canvas

- 1920×1080
- Safe area: keep ~5% margin from each edge
- 8px spacing grid, 16px corner radius on cards (standard practice — not from the brand doc,
  should be confirmed once we have it)

## Colors (placeholders — need real hex values from the brand guideline doc)

| Mode | Background | Text |
|---|---|---|
| Light | off-white, slightly cool tint | dark navy |
| Dark | near-black | off-white |
| Bright/minimal | white | dark navy |

## Typography

| Role | Size | Weight | Max lines |
|---|---|---|---|
| Title | 64px | Bold | 1 |
| Body | 40px | Regular | 3 |
| Caption | 28px | Regular | 2 |
| Takeaway text | 56px | Bold | 2 |

Font family isn't specified anywhere in what we have — using a plain geometric sans (Inter or
Poppins) as a placeholder until the brand typeface is confirmed.

## Pacing

- Minimum scene hold time: 4s
- Typical: 15-35s
- Max: 45s (past that, split into more scenes)
- Max ~4 bullet points or ~40 words per scene

## Transitions

Cross-fade, 400-600ms, between all scene types. Nothing fancier for v1 — the reference video
doesn't use hard cuts.

## What happens when content is missing or too long

| Situation | What happens |
|---|---|
| Required field missing | Show a placeholder, log a warning, never fail the render |
| Text too long | Cut at the nearest word boundary, add "…", log a warning |
| Media missing / broken link | Fall back to a text-only version of that scene |
| Unknown layout name from Scene Planner | Default to `text_explanation` |
| No visual elements at all | Just show title/body centered, no media area |

## Per-layout specs

### `title_intro`
- Mode: Light
- Required: `title` (1 line)
- Optional: `subtitle`, `background_media`
- Placement: title centered, subtitle right below it
- Hold time: 4-8s

### `narrator_note`
- Mode: Dark
- Required: `statement_text` (max 2 lines)
- Optional: `avatar_icon` (generic icon, not a photo), `attribution_label`
- Placement: statement centered, icon top-left if present, label under the statement
- Hold time: 8-15s

### `text_explanation`
- Mode: Light
- Required: `body_text` (max 3 lines, ~40 words)
- Optional: `heading`, small `supporting_icon`
- Placement: heading on top, body centered-left, icon on the right
- Hold time: 15-35s — this is the most-used layout

### `image_media`
- Mode: Dark
- Required: `media_asset`
- Optional: `caption`, `heading`
- Placement: media takes ~70% of the width, centered, caption below it
- Hold time: 15-35s
- If media is missing → falls back to text-only, per the table above

### `comparison`
- Mode: Light
- Required: `left_item` {label, points (max 3)}, `right_item` {label, points (max 3)}
- Optional: `heading`
- Placement: two columns, labels on top, bullets below
- Hold time: 20-40s

### `step_by_step`
- Mode: Light
- Required: `steps[]` (2-5 items, each with a label + short line of text)
- Optional: `heading`
- Placement: numbered vertical list
- If there are more than 5 steps, split into multiple scenes instead of cutting steps out —
  losing a step changes the meaning, so truncating isn't safe here
- Hold time: ~4-8s per step

### `key_takeaway`
- Mode: Bright
- Required: `takeaway_text` (max 2 lines)
- No optional fields — kept minimal on purpose
- Placement: centered, generous whitespace around it
- Hold time: 8-15s

### `closing_cta`
- Mode: Dark
- Required: `closing_message`
- Optional: `cta_text`, `logo`
- Placement: message centered in the top half, CTA below it, logo at the bottom
- Hold time: 6-10s